<h1>binary insertion sort</h1>
<p>
(algorithm)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
<a href="insertionSort.html"><em>Insertion sort</em></a> in which the proper location for the next item is found with a <a href="binarySearch.html"><em>binary search</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Generalization</strong> (I am a kind of ...)<br>
<a href="insertionSort.html"><em>insertion sort</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>
